[{"blockId":"root","children":[{"blockId":"o9y5ll91y","children":[{"blockId":"6ppkosypz","children":[{"blockId":"5h9251jgv","children":[],"baseStyles":{},"rawStyles":{},"mobileStyles":{},"tabletStyles":{},"attributes":{"src":"http://89.58.7.82:8000/files/XAcct-Logo-Invert-trans.png"},"classes":[],"dataKey":null,"blockName":"img","isChildOfComponent":"c9cbe3aa85591866","referenceBlockId":"r0muirwaj","customAttributes":{}},{"blockId":"ey07lw11c","children":[],"baseStyles":{},"rawStyles":{},"mobileStyles":{},"tabletStyles":{},"attributes":{"src":"http://89.58.7.82:8000/files/landing.png"},"classes":[],"dataKey":null,"blockName":"img","isChildOfComponent":"c9cbe3aa85591866","referenceBlockId":"r0muirwaj","customAttributes":{}},{"blockId":"uppw4fdeq","children":[],"baseStyles":{},"rawStyles":{},"mobileStyles":{},"tabletStyles":{},"attributes":{},"classes":[],"dataKey":null,"blockName":"Embed HTML","innerHTML":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>ERP Navigation</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .sidebar {
      width: 240px;
      background-color: #333;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      float: left;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      padding-top: 100px;
      z-index: 999;
    }

    .logo-container {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 10px;
      background-color: #222;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .sidebar-logo {
      max-height: 80px;
      width: auto;
    }

    .burger_nav {
      background-color: transparent;
      margin-top: 9px;
    }

    .burger_nav p {
      color: white;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .burger_nav p:hover {
      background-color: #444;
    }

    .burger_child {
      display: none;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }

    .burger_nav a {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: #bbb;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: 0.3s;
      white-space: nowrap;
      position: relative;
    }

    .burger_nav a i {
      width: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-right: 10px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .burger_nav a:hover {
      background-color: #575757;
      color: white;
    }

    .burger_nav a.active-link {
      background-color: #ddd;
      color: black;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only {
      width: 60px;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only .burger_nav p span,
    .sidebar.icon-only .burger_nav a span {
      display: none;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only .burger_nav a::after {
      content: attr(title);
      font-size: 14px;
      position: absolute;
      left: 70px;
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: 0.3s;
      pointer-events: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only .burger_nav a:hover::after {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .sidebar.fully-hidden {
      transform: translateX(-100%);
    }

    .toggle-btn {
      position: fixed;
      top: 85px;
      left: 225px;
      background-color: #EF6C00;
      color: white;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 1001;
      box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only ~ .toggle-btn {
      left: 60px;
    }

    .sidebar.fully-hidden ~ .toggle-btn {
      left: 0;
    }

    .main-container {
      display: flex;
      height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    iframe#iframe-obj {
      flex-grow: 1;
      height: 100vh;
      border: none;
      margin-left: 240px;
      transition: margin-left 0.3s;
    }

    .sidebar.icon-only ~ iframe#iframe-obj {
      margin-left: 60px;
    }

    .sidebar.fully-hidden ~ iframe#iframe-obj {
      margin-left: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-hover-area {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 10px;
      height: 100vh;
      z-index: 998;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="main-container">
  <!-- Sidebar -->
  <div class="sidebar" id="sidebarNav">
    <div class="logo-container">
      <img src="http://89.58.7.82:8000/files/XAcct-Logo-Invert-trans.png" alt="logo" class="sidebar-logo">
    </div>

    <!-- Sales Menu -->
    <div class="burger_nav">
      <p onclick="toggleShow('salesLinks');"><i class="fa fa-pie-chart"></i><span>&nbsp;Sales</span></p>
      <div class="burger_child" id="salesLinks">
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/quotation'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Sales Quotes"><i class="fa fa-file-text-o"></i><span>Sales Quotes</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/sales-invoice/view/list'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Sales Invoices"><i class="fa fa-file-text-o"></i><span>Sales Invoices</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/payment-entry'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Sales Payments"><i class="fa fa-credit-card"></i><span>Sales Payments</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/customer'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Customers"><i class="fa fa-users"></i><span>Customers</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/item?disabled=0'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Sales Items"><i class="fa fa-cubes"></i><span>Sales Items</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Purchase Menu -->
    <div class="burger_nav">
      <p onclick="toggleShow('purchaseLinks');"><i class="fa fa-shopping-bag"></i><span>&nbsp;Purchases</span></p>
      <div class="burger_child" id="purchaseLinks">
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/purchase-invoice'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Purchase Invoices"><i class="fa fa-file-alt"></i><span>Purchase Invoices</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/payment-entry'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Purchase Payments"><i class="fa fa-credit-card"></i><span>Purchase Payments</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/supplier'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Suppliers"><i class="fa fa-industry"></i><span>Suppliers</span></a>
        <a href="#" onclick="changeIframeUrl(BASE_URL + '/app/purchase-order'); setActiveLink(event); return false;" title="Purchase Items"><i class="fa fa-cube"></i><span>Purchase Items</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toggle Button Always on Top -->
  <div class="toggle-btn" onclick="toggleMenuMode()" id="collapseArrow">
    <i id="arrowIcon" class="fa fa-bars"></i> <!-- Use fa-angle-right if you prefer an arrow -->
  </div>

  <!-- Hover area to trigger sidebar show -->
  <div class="sidebar-hover-area" onmouseover="revealSidebar()"></div>

  <!-- Iframe to show content -->
  <iframe id="iframe-obj" src=""></iframe>
</div>

<script>
  const BASE_URL = "http://89.58.7.82:8000";

  function toggleShow(elementId) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.burger_child').forEach(child => {
      if (child.id !== elementId) child.style.display = 'none';
    });
    const target = document.getElementById(elementId);
    target.style.display = target.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';
  }

  function changeIframeUrl(url) {
    document.getElementById('iframe-obj').src = url;
  }

  function setActiveLink(event) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.burger_nav a').forEach(link => {
      link.classList.remove('active-link');
    });
    const anchor = event.target.closest('a');
    if (anchor) anchor.classList.add('active-link');
  }

  function toggleMenuMode() {
    const sidebar = document.getElementById('sidebarNav');
    const arrowIcon = document.getElementById('arrowIcon');
    const isCollapsed = sidebar.classList.toggle('fully-hidden');

    // Toggle between right and left arrows
    if (isCollapsed) {
      arrowIcon.className = 'fa fa-bars';
    } else {
      arrowIcon.className = 'fa fa-angle-left';
    }
  }

  document.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
    const sidebar = document.getElementById('sidebarNav');
    const isClickInside = sidebar.contains(e.target);
    const isArrowClick = e.target.closest('.toggle-btn');

    if (!isClickInside && !isArrowClick) {
      sidebar.classList.add('fully-hidden');
    }
  });

  function revealSidebar() {
    const sidebar = document.getElementById('sidebarNav');
    if (sidebar.classList.contains('fully-hidden')) {
      sidebar.classList.remove('fully-hidden');
    }
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>


